sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as MainActivity
    participant UserMgr as UserManager
    participant DB as AppDatabase
    participant Engine as RoutingEngine & MeshTransports
    participant Watchdog as Heartbeat Watchdog

    App->>App: onCreate() Initialized
    App->>DB: setAllOffline() & clean stale alerts
    App->>UserMgr: hasIdentity() Check
    alt No Nickname Set
        App->>App: Prompt Name Dialog & Save Nickname
    else Identity Exists
        UserMgr-->>App: Return Username
    end

    App->>Engine: Initialize Hybrid Mesh (Nearby + Wi-Fi Direct)
    App->>Watchdog: Start Heartbeat Runnable (10s interval)

    loop Every 10 Seconds
        Watchdog->>Engine: Send Presence Heartbeat Beacon
        Watchdog->>Engine: purgeExpiredRoutes() (35s TTL)
        Watchdog->>DB: Update Offline States for Dropped Peers
    end

    Note over App: User Exits App or Swipes Away
    App->>App: onDestroy() Triggered
    App->>Watchdog: removeCallbacks(watchdogRunnable)
    App->>Engine: resetRadio(forceStopAll=true)
    App->>Engine: shutdown WifiP2pMeshManager
    App->>DB: setAllOffline() in SQLite